  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5b72b968ab35b7747863b866328637d6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizManagerArun
  questions:
  - questionText: 1,When Tenali Raman found out about the debate, what did he do?
    option1: He became invisible so he could enter the Durbar.
    option2: He bought books and prepared for the debate.
    option3: He found a way to enter the Durbar without an  invitation
    option4: He offered to livestream the debate.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8942e610e36c27946b54391ba97b6695, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: f783b04673e10514284a315392b8f1fe, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 0
  - questionText: 2,What was the topic of the debate ?
    option1: Education
    option2: Illusion.
    option3: Corruption.
    option4: Engineering.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 216c71249e04d2244b51fc82f0085616, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: dfb169d06a5aa86459dd296c57be41c3, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 3,What did the Philosopher say ____
    option1: Everything is a dream.
    option2: We are all acting in a movie.
    option3: Everything around us is an illusion.
    option4: Our thoughts make everything appear real.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6bef5e2c76cefbc41a5fe2e50b47dca5, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 9c2d279c3105ddd4088e8953587c9132, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 4,How did the other scholars react to the philosophy of the Northern
      scholar ?
    option1: He is dumb.
    option2: He needs to visit a doctor!
    option3: Is he real or an illusion ?
    option4: What a brillant philosopher!
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 1
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 25995945703982e4bb682446d236b3a5, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 590c654fe5958a7488e3aabc5d076012, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 5
  - questionText: 5,King Krishnadevaraya felt dejected. Why?
    option1: His mic stopped working.
    option2: "He couldn\u2019t understand the philosophy."
    option3: No one from his durbar stood up to challenge the philosopher.
    option4: The scholar was wearing better clothes than him.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a00025275b966904c8a4ff0f66052426, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: af3444ab26ddc8a4db7d5d38a235771a, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: "6,What was Tenali Raman\u2019s witty encounter?\LIf everything
      is an illusion, then_____"
    option1: "icecream isn\u2019t real ?"
    option2: let the scholar fill his stomach by merly thinking about the food.
    option3: your wealth is also not real so donate everything to me
    option4: you being a scolar is also an illusion ?
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fba8d7d957273f44caa53ba673ee537a, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: e9a48291a61e62f4093106f44b38a365, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 5
  - questionText: 7,Extremely pleased, the King gave gifts and gold  coins to ___
    option1: everyone in the durbar.
    option2: scholars.
    option3: the Queen.
    option4: Tenali Raman.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 1
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c0f061061bf4094439068201643b4016, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: e8b0fc668218d2348ac0c3b507a120e5, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 3
  - questionText: 8,In our life, every situation is _______
    option1: a piece of cake.
    option2: a battle
    option3: an opportunity
    option4: a playdoh
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da849b96460f3404ca95107836cb2826, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 9bc7a0bc8cb2cd9488ade46c409ff521, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
